From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:52:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tcp: backport the rate sample and TLP infrastructure for BBRv3

Backport the TCP infrastructure that BBRv3 builds on: the rate sample
delivery/CE/loss counters, 32-bit skb send timestamps, TX in-flight
tracking, TLP recovery notification, CE event delivery and the
tcp_snd_cwnd() helpers.

Also add the RTAX/ECN feature bits shared by PLB and BBRv3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

Origin: WildKernels 5.10 BBRv3 backport, original from Google bbr-v3-2024-02-22-01 (fatalcoder524)（本补丁：tcp_rate/TLP/ECN 基建）
Upstream-Status: Backport
KABI: tcp_skb_cb 与 rate_sample 的新字段放在 __GENKSYMS__ 之外
Depends-On: none
Tested-On: yudi 5.10.272（r2 构建与开机）, 2026-10-29
---
